  "description": "Change of use of first floor from retail (A1) to 2 residential flats (C3). (Summary)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Prior to occupation details shall be submitted and approved in writing of waste storage areas for the two flats and three (3) enclosed and secure off-highway cycle parking spaces to be provided at this site. These shall be provided at the site before first occupation of the approved use.\n\nReason: In order to ensure that satisfactory provision is made to accommodate waste and bicycles storage within the site, and to accord with Policies 6.13 of the London Plan, LP23 and LP24 of the Council's Local Plan."
